    {
      "id": 40,
      "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline",
      "pos": [
        0,
        1280
      ],
      "size": [
        520,
        470
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 8,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "STRING",
          "type": "STRING",
          "links": [
            4
          ],
          "slot_index": 0
        }
      ],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] A low, wide cinematic shot reveals the enormous temple gate above the clouds. The white-robed swordswoman stands on the left and the armored spear warrior on the right, facing each other across the platform. The camera slowly pushes closer as wind sweeps their robes. They dash toward each other and meet at the center; her silver sword blocks his bronze spear with a sharp burst of golden sparks. End with the two weapons pressed together, both fighters braced in a clear side-on composition. overall_soundscape: High mountain wind, rushing cloth, footsteps on stone, one resonant metallic clash. non_diegetic_music: Epic low strings, deep ceremonial drums and distant brass, no vocals."
      ],
      "title": "Shot 1 / 0-7.5s"
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline",
      "pos": [
        0,
        1840
      ],
      "size": [
        520,
        470
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 9,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "STRING",
          "type": "STRING",
          "links": [
            5
          ],
          "slot_index": 0
        }
      ],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 2] Sustain the same central weapon lock and camera framing for the first second. The swordswoman pivots smoothly to her left and deflects the spear; the armored warrior turns and sweeps the spear in a broad horizontal arc. She ducks under the sweep and counters with one precise rising sword slash, leaving a thin cyan energy trail. The camera makes a measured lateral arc, keeping both full bodies and the contact of the weapons readable. End with them separating by three paces, facing each other with weapons raised. overall_soundscape: Two clear metal impacts, spear whoosh, cloth and sliding boots. non_diegetic_music: Continue the same cinematic low strings and driving ceremonial drums, no vocals."
      ],
      "title": "Shot 2 / 7.5-15s"
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline",
      "pos": [
        0,
        2400
      ],
      "size": [
        520,
        470
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 10,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "STRING",
          "type": "STRING",
          "links": [
            6
          ],
          "slot_index": 0
        }
      ],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 3] Sustain the same crossed sword and spear for the first second: the armored warrior on the left and the white-robed swordswoman on the right, costumes and lighting unchanged. Amber energy gathers along his spear and brilliant cyan energy flows along her sword toward their point of contact. One powerful cyan-and-gold energy collision erupts between the locked weapons. A broad luminous circular shockwave races across the stone platform and into the cloud sea, lifting small stone fragments and streaming their robes backward. Both slide backward three paces while keeping their feet on the stone. The camera pulls wider to reveal the enormous jade gate above the expanding energy ring. End with both upright on opposite sides amid drifting dust and fading sparks. overall_soundscape: Rising energy hum, a deep impact and stone fragments scattering, wind. non_diegetic_music: Rising orchestral brass, strings and heavy drums, no vocals."
      ],
      "title": "Shot 3 / 15-22.5s"
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline",
      "pos": [
        0,
        2960
      ],
      "size": [
        520,
        470
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 11,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "STRING",
          "type": "STRING",
          "links": [
            7
          ],
          "slot_index": 0
        }
      ],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 4] Hold the previous wide composition and crossed weapons for the first second: the white-robed swordswoman on the left and the armored warrior on the right beneath the jade gate. She twists her sword in one decisive downward parry, knocking the long spear out of his hands onto the stone. The warrior sinks to one knee beside the fallen spear. She takes one calm step backward and lowers her silver sword, its cyan light fading. The camera slowly cranes back into a majestic wide shot: the two small figures beneath the immense broken jade gate, clouds moving below, sunlight breaking through. Hold this resolved final composition. overall_soundscape: One final metallic strike, cloth settling and mountain wind. non_diegetic_music: A final orchestral chord with deep drums fading into sustained strings, no vocals."
      ],
      "title": "Shot 4 / 22.5-30s"
    },
