      "widgets_values": [
        "tianmen-duel-30s",
        "",
        "A cinematic live-action Chinese xianxia martial arts film, photorealistic faces and practical flowing costumes, realistic movement and physically grounded sword choreography enhanced by restrained supernatural effects. Two adult East Asian opponents: a young swordswoman with long black hair tied in a high ponytail, ivory-white flowing robes, a teal silk sash and a straight silver jian sword; a tall male warrior in black and bronze lamellar armor, a dark crimson cape, carrying a long bronze spear. They fight on a broad circular weathered stone platform floating above a vast bright cloud sea, beneath a colossal broken jade temple gate, distant mountain peaks, warm sunlight and cool atmospheric shadows. Both fighters stay visible, anatomically clear and consistent. Rich jade, silver and crimson colors, natural film contrast, detailed fabric and metal, readable action, full-frame composition, no text or subtitles.",
